<title>POLAND: Budimex signs PLN 66.3 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex signs PLN 66.3 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Budimex SA on Wednesday signed a 66.3-million-zloty contract to build a waste incinerating facility in Warsaw, the company's president said.</p>
<p>&quot;Today we have signed a contract on building an incinerator in Warsaw,&quot; Grzegorz Tuderek told a news conference.</p>
<p>The project will be financed by the city of Warsaw and Polish firm System Eko and the works would be carried out in 23 months, starting from this month.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
